---
# Test code inherits the root configuration with two GoogleTest-specific exceptions:
#   bugprone-unchecked-optional-access: the check cannot see that ASSERT_TRUE(opt.has_value())
#     returns from the test body, so every guarded access is flagged. Guard with ASSERT, never EXPECT.
#   cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes: protected members in
#     ::testing::Test fixtures are the documented GoogleTest pattern.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes
...
